{"excerpt_id":"ex_914d01359b57_017","source_id":"src_914d01359b57","source_hash":"faf4c1aac553684b911cd1ee121e23e291257107f63f96b4880907a80d145ac8","text":"In addition to the common fields , OfferCancel transactions use the following fields:","location_hint":"paragraph 232","char_start":4955,"char_end":5040,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:52.930Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_914d01359b57_018","source_id":"src_914d01359b57","source_hash":"faf4c1aac553684b911cd1ee121e23e291257107f63f96b4880907a80d145ac8","text":"Field JSON Type Internal Type Description","location_hint":"paragraph 233","char_start":5044,"char_end":5085,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:52.930Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_914d01359b57_019","source_id":"src_914d01359b57","source_hash":"faf4c1aac553684b911cd1ee121e23e291257107f63f96b4880907a80d145ac8","text":"OfferSequence Number UInt32 The sequence number (or Ticket number) of a previous OfferCreate transaction. If specified, cancel any offer object in the ledger that was created by that transaction. It is not considered an error if the offer specified does not exist.","location_hint":"paragraph 234","char_start":5089,"char_end":5353,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:52.930Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_914d01359b57_020","source_id":"src_914d01359b57","source_hash":"faf4c1aac553684b911cd1ee121e23e291257107f63f96b4880907a80d145ac8","text":"To remove an old offer and replace it with a new one, you can use an OfferCreate transaction with an OfferSequence parameter, instead of using OfferCancel and another OfferCreate.","location_hint":"paragraph 236","char_start":5364,"char_end":5543,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:52.930Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_914d01359b57_021","source_id":"src_914d01359b57","source_hash":"faf4c1aac553684b911cd1ee121e23e291257107f63f96b4880907a80d145ac8","text":"The OfferCancel method returns tesSUCCESS even if it did not find an offer with the matching sequence number.","location_hint":"paragraph 237","char_start":5545,"char_end":5654,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:21:52.930Z"}
